          { "@type": "Question", "name": "What fish species are available on Relifish?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Relifish sellers offer Surmai (सुरमई), Pomfret (पापलेट), Rawas (रावस), Bangda (बांगडा), Prawns (कोलंबी), Bombay Duck (बोंबील), Crab, and seasonal catch — availability varies by seller and season." } },
